the-firm-as-one-program-12 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-12 = unlines (cons "- **P1** Observation fibers: what a reading warrants, and when a participant is safe to act (hyperactivity v31 §1, §10.4)." (cons "  An observation does not tell you which history happened. It tells you which histories remain compatible with what was seen: the fiber of the observation. What a reading warrants is whatever holds for every history in that fiber, and a refined observation shrinks the fiber, so a conclusion already established stays established. Nothing is guessed and no probability is introduced to hide what is missing. The same construction says when an action is safe, what a participant in a distributed system knows, and what a debugger can still say about a run it only partly saw (hyperactivity v31, §1 and §10.4)." nil))
